      "content": "that's a good start but it's a bit brief for a grad paper. could u go a bit deeper into the conservative side? like what are the actual philosophical or theological frameworks they use to justify the sanctity of life beyond just \"it's a gift\"? i want to make sure i'm not just treating them as shut-down arguments.",
